  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Clusters Linking and Learning event 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the Impact Clusters Linking and Learning event, Dutch and national participants from eligible countries will have learned what the success factors and the typical failures are when designing and managing an Impact Clusters project and they will establish, renew or deepen relations which will increase the effectiveness and sustainability of ongoing and future Impact Clusters and related the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) support.</narrative>
  </description>
